---
import SectionHeading from "./SectionHeading.astro";
---

<section class="founder">

  <div class="container founder-grid">

    <div class="founder-image">

      <!-- Replace this with your photo later -->
      <div class="founder-placeholder">

        <span>O</span>

      </div>

    </div>

    <div class="founder-content">

      <SectionHeading
        eyebrow="FROM OUR FOUNDER"
        title="Welcome Home"
        text=""
      />

      <p>

        When God placed Christian Women Community on my heart,
        it wasn't simply to create another women's organisation.

      </p>

      <p>

        It was to build a home.

      </p>

      <p>

        A place where women can encounter Christ deeply,
        discover their God-given purpose, build meaningful
        relationships, flourish in every area of life and
        become everything God created them to be.

      </p>

      <p>

        Whether you are seeking spiritual growth,
        genuine sisterhood, encouragement,
        opportunities to serve or a place where
        your gifts can flourish, I want you to know
        that you belong here.

      </p>

      <p>

        My prayer is that every Virtuosa becomes
        stronger in faith, richer in purpose and
        empowered to influence her world for Christ.

      </p>

      <h3>

        Welcome Home.

      </h3>

      <div class="signature">

        <strong>Olu</strong>

        <span>

          Founder

        </span>

      </div>

      <a href="/about" class="btn-primary">

        Read Our Story →

      </a>

    </div>

  </div>

</section>